<section class="gg-home-hero">
  <div class="gg-bg-mesh"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-home-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-home-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>

      <h1>A calmer way to keep becoming.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower turns goals into living plants, so progress feels visual,
        personal, and worth returning to.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#runthrough" class="gg-btn-soft">Watch the App</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-phone-scene reveal">
      <div class="gg-float-card float-one">
        <strong>Return</strong>
        <span>without shame</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-float-card float-two">
        <strong>Grow</strong>
        <span>with small actions</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone-frame hero-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '1000x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower garden screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-phone-frame mini-hero-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker small"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '700x' | img_tag: 'Goal Grower goal list screen' }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-belief-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-glass-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The feeling</span>
      <h2>Most goal apps ask you to perform. Goal Grower invites you to return.</h2>
      <p>
        It is built for imperfect days, quiet progress, and goals that need care
        over time — not pressure, guilt, or another cold checklist.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-flow-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">The flow</span>
      <h2>From empty space to visible growth.</h2>
      <p>
        The page now follows the actual app journey using matching screenshots.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-flow-row">
      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Start fresh</h3>
          <p>Begin with a quiet space where your goals can take shape.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-no-goals-yet.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'No goals yet screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Choose what matters</h3>
          <p>See your goals clearly instead of losing them in a list of tasks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-only-goal-list-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal list screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="gg-flow-card reveal">
        <div class="gg-flow-copy">
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Watch it become real</h3>
          <p>Your effort becomes a garden you can see and come back to.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="gg-phone-frame flow-phone">
          <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
          <div class="gg-phone-screen">
            {{ 'gg-exercise-more-before-placed-garden-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Garden screen' }}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-runthrough-section" id="runthrough">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal center">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Runthrough</span>
      <h2>See the app in motion.</h2>
      <p>
        A quick look at how Goal Grower feels when you move through the real app.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-runthrough-phone-wrap reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-frame runthrough-phone">
        <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
        <div class="gg-phone-screen">
          <video
            src="{{ 'Screen_Recording_goal-grower-runthrough.mp4' | asset_url }}"
            autoplay
            muted
            loop
            playsinline
            preload="metadata"
          ></video>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-details-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal details</span>
      <h2>Progress needs a place to be understood.</h2>
      <p>
        The garden gives the emotion. The details screen gives the structure.
        Together, they make goals feel both meaningful and manageable.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-phone-frame detail-phone reveal">
      <div class="gg-phone-speaker"></div>
      <div class="gg-phone-screen">
        {{ 'gg-exercise-more-goal-details-view.png' | asset_img_url: '900x' | img_tag: 'Goal details screen' }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-shared-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-shared-card reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="gg-kicker">Shared gardens</span>
        <h2>Grow with people who are growing too.</h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <p>
          Create shared gardens with friends, family, classmates, spouses, or
          accountability partners. Everyone grows their own goals while contributing
          to something together.
        </p>

        <div class="gg-pills">
          <span>Friends</span>
          <span>Family</span>
          <span>Classmates</span>
          <span>Partners</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-growth-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Growth loop</span>
      <h2>A simple rhythm that feels alive.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-growth-grid">
      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Notice</span>
        <p>Choose what kind of person you are trying to become.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Plant</span>
        <p>Give the goal a place in your garden.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Water</span>
        <p>Use small actions to keep it alive.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-growth-card reveal">
        <span>Return</span>
        <p>Come back tomorrow and keep growing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-maker-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Built by a student</span>
      <h2>Made by someone who needed it too.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to make progress feel less cold and more alive:
        part app, part garden, part reminder that growth takes time.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-maker-card reveal">
      <h3>Current progress</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Goal tracking built</li>
        <li>Personal gardens built</li>
        <li>Shared gardens in beta</li>
        <li>Android testing next</li>
        <li>Widgets and reminders future</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-home-section gg-store-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support the build</span>
      <h2>Help the garden keep growing.</h2>
      <p>
        Support Goal Grower development, future apps, digital tools, and products
        made for intentional growth.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-store-grid">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Main</span>
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Help fund development, design, testing, and future features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Tools</span>
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, and intentional growth resources.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-store-card reveal">
        <span>Objects</span>
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta gg-final-section">
  <div class="gg-container reveal">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
  </div>
</section>

